      729      bt-not-sel-desel-all AT ROW 3.75 COL 6.88 WIDGET-ID 12 NO-TAB-STOP
      730      b-plgdspm AT ROW 4.67 COL 1
      731      SPACE(0.24) SKIP(0.44)
