      736   ASSIGN
      737      FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE = FALSE
      738      FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN     = TRUE.
      739   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
