      742      END.
      743   ON return OF search-goods IN FRAME dialog-frame
      744      DO:
      745         define variable ii as integer no-undo .
      746         assign search-goods .
      747         run sort_ .
      748      END.
      749   ON leave OF search-goods IN FRAME dialog-frame
